# Logs
# Anchored to the package root: an unanchored `logs` also matches any nested
# directory called `logs`, which silently excluded
# `src/modules/access-control/screens/logs/` from version control. Runtime logs
# only ever land at the package root, so anchoring loses nothing.
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

*storybook.log
storybook-static

# TypeScript error logs
tsc_errors.txt
type_errors.txt
final_tsc_errors*.txt
typecheck.log
